Description
The Relative Impact Analysis feature in RiskAssessor (
risk.py
) parses the endpoint URL to count the number of unique target assets affected by a workflow, which is then used to compute the blast multiplier. The target extraction logic takes the last segment of the URL path:

python

parts = [p for p in url_str.split("/") if p]
if len(parts) >= 2:
