- [#309](https://github.com/lengocanh2005it/wispace-bot/issues/309) — knowledge RAG and web search capabilities
- [#403](https://github.com/lengocanh2005it/wispace-bot/issues/403) — persistent multi-agent memory with privacy and provenance
