- OS: Windows 10/11 (Russian locale)
- Model/provider: `stepfun/step-3.7-flash:free` via `nous`
- Default provider config: main = nous, `fallback_model` cleared
- RAM/disk: `state.db` ~248 MB; Desktop restarts OK
- No GPU/driver involvement suspected; this is purely a Desktop UI/state-behavior issue.

