``DesktopState``, it follows the ``RestoresFrom`` edge into a previous
``Session`` and prints every ``Exchange`` it still contains. The demo shows
that even after ``here.exchanges == []`` (the source of truth was cleared),
the typed edge still points at the stale Session, so the UI happily
rehydrates from it.
