Issue #299: QuickPlay v0: prompt → playable → revise → keep

QuickPlay v0 is the shortest path to the actual household game system. Its controlling denominator is prompt-to-playable latency, not UNDERDRAIN, ARC, Quest, Shape Field, or physical acceptance.

