```text
child describes a small game
→ agentic builder produces a playable web game
→ mechanical playability gate passes
→ Rodoh launches it
→ keyboard/gamepad semantic controls work
→ child asks for a revision
→ revised immutable candidate plays
→ KEEP freezes a portable offline cartridge
→ cartridge reopens later without the provider or internet
```

Execution order:

```text
0–6h    sandbox player + Tiny Planet fixture + keyboard/gamepad bus
6–16h   OpenGame-class local builder sidecar + Three.js template
16–24h  Playwright build/runtime/playability repair loop
24–36h  Rodoh Make / Play / Change It / Keep UI
36–48h  portable offline KEEP cartridge + existing library integration
48–72h  television/fullscreen + MotionDeck semantic control adapter
```

