The book is a sequence of printable pages: a cover followed by paired
maze/solution spreads. Walking the book with a librarian walker prints
each page in order, mirroring the hand-rolled traversal the issue
complains about. A second walker simulates "printing" by visiting every
page in book order, demonstrating reachability over the chained edges.
"""

