Models the dependency chain between phase gates (G2, G3, G6) and the
performance checkpoints (latency budget <5 s for G2 cold start, <50 ms
for G3 search). A walker re-walks the train, re-measures both numbers
on the reference build, and flags regressions that block the G6
release per the project's Constitution.
