**Application.** Persist an auditable coverage/supersession link and reason; move only eligible stale artifacts to the correct terminal lane; clear stale health/active status safely; emit bounded deltas; be idempotent on retry. Do not alter the already-complete covering root, code history, review evidence, unrelated tasks, or active Workers.

