This goal is discovered automation debt from PR #1617. Keep it as the single canonical follow-up lane. Do not dispatch a second implementation worker while the existing PR #1617 repair is actively claimed or unresolved. Once that lane is terminal or demonstrably unclaimed and safely released, the canonical scheduler/conveyor may select this goal.

