The real issue is a stale install pipeline. We model its essential shape:
LineageWeave PRs pass through a sandbox whose two install halves
(pip-hash-locked Python deps, pnpm JS deps) must both succeed before
OpenCode can approve. We trace the dependency tree as a typed graph and
walk it with an auditor that reports which nodes are unreachable because
of the sandbox defects described in the issue.
