deep, but the rendering walker should report counts up to a configurable
``reply_limit`` per branch, exactly the policy the issue asks for ("Load More
Comments when replies goes 5+"). The walker walks the ``ThreadedReply``
typed edge from parent to child, accumulating visible replies and flagging
branches that overflow so a "Load More" affordance can be shown.
