## Tasks

- [ ] Analyze symmetric encryption under Grover's quadratic speedup:
  - [ ] AES-128 -> 64-bit effective security (vulnerable, below 128-bit threshold)
  - [ ] AES-192 -> 96-bit effective security (marginal)
  - [ ] AES-256 -> 128-bit effective security (safe)
- [ ] Analyze hash functions under Grover's speedup:
  - [ ] SHA-256 -> 128-bit collision resistance (mostly safe, but consider upgrade paths)
  - [ ] SHA-384 -> 192-bit collision resistance (safe)
