Issue #1370: Stack overflow crash from infinite self-recursion in an Application.Idle event handler

## Overview

osu!stable (Windows, .NET Framework 4.8, 32-bit under WOW64) crashes to desktop with `STATUS_STACK_OVERFLOW` (`0xc00000fd`) on the main UI thread. A full user-mode dump shows an obfuscated `(System.Object, System.EventArgs)` handler recursing directly into itself ~80,000 times within a single handler invocation until the 1 MB stack guard page is hit. The recursion is direct self-recursion (every frame has the identical return address `1b304693`), not a mutual-recursion cycle.

## Faulting stack (WinDbg `cdb`, Microsoft public symbols)

```
