                        #=zQVBvbKEYcRNzZRCV3N95NPI=.#=z_zkUO_ba4r1XXEW6lQ==(System.Object, System.EventArgs)
                          #=zjEbjSe8mZyXpwbL6Wfuq1CQ=.#=z7BsjUus=(System.Object, System.EventArgs)
                            #=zqnplzcu4PDXXUxHcEg==.#=zxfD3mJTKEx8P(System.Object, System.EventArgs)
                              ... same frame repeats ~80,000 times at +0x1b, 12 bytes per frame ...
                                -> guard page, STATUS_STACK_OVERFLOW
```

The handler entered from `FPushMessageLoop` (`#=zQVBvbKEYcRNzZRCV3N95NPI=.#=z_zkUO_ba4r1XXEW6lQ==`) is on the `Application.Idle` path. The recursion target is `#=zqnplzcu4PDXXUxHcEg==.#=zxfD3mJTKEx8P`, self-calling at `+0x1b`.

## Frequency

