- Run the stable subset in CI on a Docker-capable runner.
- Keep slow or environment-specific scenarios separately selectable.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] The scenario set covers every diagnostic tool that depends on runtime Docker state.
- [ ] Healthy fixtures never produce blocking validation or smoke-test failures.
- [ ] Each intentionally broken fixture asserts the expected root-cause category, service, evidence, and severity.
- [ ] Secret fixtures assert that the synthetic value is absent from MCP responses and audit/error logs.
