Models the essence of `call_chain(src, dst, max_depth)`: BFS through a
directed call graph between symbols (functions/methods), honoring a
depth limit and a visited-set cap to stay safe on cyclic graphs, and
returning the shortest ordered path of fully-qualified names (FQNs) or
`None` when no path fits inside the budget.
